  "solution": "**Given **\n\na ∶ b = √7 ∶ √ 3\n\n**Formula used**\n\n(a + b)² = a² + b² + 2ab\n\n(a² - b²) = (a + b) (a - b)\n\n**calculation**\n\nlet a = √7x and b = √3x\n\n(3 × √7x + 2 × √3x)/(3 × √ 7x - 2 × √3x)\n\n[{(3 × √7x + 2 × √3x) × (3 × √ 7x + 2 × √3x)}]/ [{(3 × √7x - 2 × √3x) × (3 × √ 7x + 2 × √3x)}]\n\n(3√7x)² + (2√3x)² + 2 (3√7x)(2√ 3x)/{(3√7x)² - (2√3x)²}\n\n(63x² + 12x² + 12√ 21x²)/(63x² - 12x²)\n\n(75 + 12√ 21)/51\n\n(25 + 4√ 21)/1**7**\n\n**Check option 2**\n\n(2 + √21)/(- 2 + √21)\n\nRationalize multiply (2 + √21) both numerator and denominator \n\n⇒ (2 + √21)² /(- 2 + √21)(2 + √21)\n\n⇒ (25 + 4√ 21)/17\n\n**∴ The value of (3a + 2b) : (3a – 2b) is equal to frac{2 + sqrt{21}}{(-2 + sqrt{21})}**\n\nfd",
